  "description": "XENOTYPE is an dark science fiction series that combines the best of western storytelling with shonen battle manga!\n\nThis genre redefining epic introduces the high-flying transformation hero ESPER and showcases his first contact with the enigmatic horrors of the BLACK DIAMOND conspiracy!\n\nIf you're a fan of Akira, Attack on Titan, Bio-Booster Armor Guyver or Tokyo Ghoul, XENOTYPE is going to blow your mind!  Don't Miss Out!\n\nFeaturing the art of multi-award winning mangaka, Odysseas Theodoratos!\n\nIf you've found your interest in mainstream comic books waning as traditional storytelling is undermined by social agendas that pay no reverence or respect to decades of world building and character development -- if you long for a return to high-octane action with heart -- this is the series you've been waiting for!",
